  "content": "[Verse 1]\n[Dm]Rastsvetali\niabloni i [A]grushi,\nPoplyli tu-\nmany nad [Dm]rekoj.\n[F]Vykhodila\n[Gm]na bereg [Dm]Katyusha,\n[Gm]Na [Dm]vysokij\n[A]bereg na [Dm]krutoj.\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Dm]Vykhodila,\npesniu [A]zavodila\nPro stepnogo,\nsizogo [Dm]orla,\nPro [F]togo, ko-\n[Gm]torogo [Dm]liubila,\n[Gm]Pro [Dm]togo, chi\n[A]pisma [Dm]beregla.\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Dm]Oj ty, pesnia,\npesenka [A]devichia,\nTy leti za\niasnym solntsem [Dm]vsled.\nI [F]bojtsu na\n[Gm]dalnem [Dm]pograniche\n[Gm]Ot [Dm]Katyushi\n[A]peredaj [Dm]privet.\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Dm]Pust on vspomnit\ndevushku [A]prostuiu,\nPust uslyshit,\nkak ona [Dm]poet,\nPust on [F]zemliu\n[Gm]berezhet [Dm]rodnuiu,\n[Gm]A [Dm]liubov Ka-\n[A]tyusha [Dm]sberezhet.",
